  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "S3API",
      "description": "S3API - S3-as-a-Service backed by Garage. An S3 instance is a normal Velez\nservice identified by the velez.s3 container label. Velez keeps no\nper-instance table: ports are read from the container, Garage settings from\nthe service config (matreshka, or the container itself when matreshka is\noff), buckets and keys live from the Garage admin API."
    }
  ],
